<title>USA: Royal Bank of Canada sets 300 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank of Canada sets 300 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from</p>
<p>Royal Bank of Canada was priced on Wednesday, according to</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER ROYAL BANK OF CANADA</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 10/24/2011</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.844  FIRST PAY DATE 05/24/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3   YIELD 6.773 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD 64 BP	CALLABLE N.A.</p>
<p>UNDERLYING: 10-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
